{"study_accession":"PRJNA863573","secondary_study_accession":"SRP388762","title":"RNA Sequencing of peripheral blood mononuclear cells (PBMCs) isolated from epilepsy patients treated with vagus nerve stimulation and not treated with vagus nerve stimulation.","description":"Purpose: To decipher the mechanisms responsible for the protective function of vagus nerve stimulation. Methods: Blood was collected from Control and Treated patients followed by isolation of PBMC'S. Total RNA was extracted and RNA sequencing was done following standard protocols Results: Detailed analysis of the transcriptomic data show that anti-inflammatory responses were upregulated in the treated samples. Conclusions: This study showed the protective role of vagus nerve stimulation in epilepsy patients. Overall design: Human PBMC's RNA seq of 4 control and treated 4 patients, using Illumina platform","pubmed":"36845140","geo_series":"","n_samples":8,"samples":[{"sample_accession":"SAMN30050163","study_accession":"PRJNA863573","blood_class":"pbmc","class_from":"sample","title":"Treated 4","description":"Treated 4","sex":"","geo_sample":"GSM6415714","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2023-03-03","attributes":[["source_name","Blood"],["tissue","PBMCs"],["treatment","vagus nerve stimulation"]],"runs":[{"run_accession":"SRR20709297","experiment_accession":"SRX16730788","library_layout":"PAIRED","library_selection":"cDNA","instrument_model":"Illumina HiSeq 4000","read_count":41765781,"base_count":12613265862,"first_public":"2023-03-03","experiment_title":"Illumina HiSeq 4000 sequencing: GSM6415714: Treated 4 Homo sapiens RNA-Seq"}],"labels":[],"single_cell":false},{"sample_accession":"SAMN30050164","study_accession":"PRJNA863573","blood_class":"pbmc","class_from":"sample","title":"Treated 3","description":"Treated 3","sex":"","geo_sample":"GSM6415713","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2023-03-03","attributes":[["source_name","Blood"],["tissue","PBMCs"],["treat